---
import ServicePageLayout from '../../layouts/ServicePageLayout.astro';
import VanSection from '../../components/VanSection.astro';
---

<ServicePageLayout
  title="All HVAC Services in Orange County | HiLo Heating & Air"
  description="Complete HVAC services across Orange County and Los Angeles — AC and heating repair, installation, replacement, maintenance, ductwork, thermostat, and ductless systems. Same-day service. Get a free estimate!"
  heroTitle="All HVAC Services in Orange County"
  heroSubtitle="Heating, cooling, ductwork, indoor air quality, ductless systems, and comfort controls — one local team for your whole home. Pick the service you need below."
  faqKey="services"
>
  <section class="pt-4 sm:pt-8 pb-16 sm:pb-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-lg">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-0 mb-4">Start With the Problem, Not the Product</h2>
      <p>Most people don't know which service they need when they call. They know the AC quit, or one bedroom is warm, or the furnace clicked off in January. That's enough. This page is a map — find the symptom that matches yours, and we'll point you at the page that actually solves it.</p>
      <p>We're a local family-owned team working out of Stanton since 2016, covering <a href="/service-areas/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Orange County and Los Angeles</a>. Licensed C-20 contractors, bonded, insured, EPA-certified technicians. If it can't wait, our <a href="/services/hvac-services/emergency-hvac-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">24/7 emergency line</a> is answered by a person, not a voicemail.</p>

      <h2>Which Page Do You Actually Need?</h2>
      <p>These are the questions we get most often, mapped to the right service:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AC runs but doesn't cool, makes noise, or leaks</strong> — <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/ac-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">AC repair</a>, or <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/emergency-ac-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">emergency AC repair</a> if it's stopped completely in the heat.</li>
        <li><strong>System runs but performs poorly every year</strong> — <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/ac-maintenance/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">AC maintenance</a> or <a href="/services/hvac-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">HVAC maintenance and system inspection</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>No heat, or a furnace that won't stay lit</strong> — <a href="/services/heating-services/heating-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">Heating repair</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>System is old, expensive, or failing repeatedly</strong> — <a href="/services/hvac-services/hvac-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">HVAC repair</a> first, then <a href="/services/hvac-services/hvac-replacement/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">replacement</a> only if the math supports it.</li>
        <li><strong>Buying equipment, or building an addition</strong> — <a href="/services/hvac-services/hvac-installation/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">HVAC installation</a>, <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/air-conditioning-installation/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">AC installation</a>, or <a href="/services/heating-services/heating-installation/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">heating installation</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Rooms uneven, dustier than usual, or ducts that sound wrong</strong> — <a href="/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/duct-cleaning/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">duct cleaning</a>, <a href="/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-duct-repair/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">duct repair</a>, or <a href="/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/hvac-air-balancing/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">air balancing</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>No ductwork, or one room that won't cooperate</strong> — <a href="/services/ductless-mini-split-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">ductless mini-split services</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>AC short-cycles or ignores the schedule</strong> — <a href="/services/thermostat-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">thermostat services</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>A business rather than a home</strong> — <a href="/services/commercial-hvac-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">commercial HVAC</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Not sure which one fits? <a href="/services/hvac-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red">HVAC services</a> covers whole-system repair, installation, replacement, and maintenance in one place.</p>

      <h2>How We Work</h2>
      <p>You call, we ask a few questions, and we give you a real arrival window instead of a vague "sometime this week." Before any work begins you know what it costs. No add-ons appearing halfway through the job, and if a repair genuinely makes more sense than a replacement, we'll tell you that — even when it means a smaller invoice for us.</p>

      <h2>Why People Stay With Us</h2>
      <p>HiLo Heating &amp; Air isn't the biggest company in Orange County, and that's the point. We show up, we're straight about pricing, and we don't disappear after the invoice. Most of our work still comes from neighbors recommending us to neighbors, which says more than any ad.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <VanSection 
    title="Our Service Fleet"
    subtitle="Professional HVAC vehicles ready to serve your home"
  />

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-50 border-y border-brand-blue/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4">Our Services</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue mb-4">Explore Our HVAC Services</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">From emergency repairs to full system installations, we deliver reliable HVAC solutions across Orange County.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5">
        {[
          { title: 'Air Conditioning', desc: 'Expert AC repair, installation, and maintenance. Same-day service with certified technicians.', href: '/services/air-conditioning-services/', icon: 'ac' },
          { title: 'Heating', desc: 'Reliable heating repair, installation, and maintenance. Keep your home warm all winter.', href: '/services/heating-services/', icon: 'heat' },
          { title: 'HVAC Services', desc: 'Complete HVAC solutions including installation, replacement, duct work, and more.', href: '/services/hvac-services/', icon: 'hvac' },
          { title: 'Indoor Air Quality', desc: 'Air purification, filtration, humidity control, and duct services for cleaner air.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/', icon: 'air' },
        ].map((svc) => {
          const icons: Record<string, string> = {
            ac: 'M12 3v2.25m6.364.386l-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364l-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227l-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 11-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 017.5 0z',
            heat: 'M15.362 5.214A8.252 8.252 0 0112 21 8.25 8.25 0 016.038 7.048 8.287 8.287 0 009 9.6a8.983 8.983 0 013.361-6.867 8.21 8.21 0 003 2.48zM12 18a3.75 3.75 0 00.495-7.467 5.99 5.99 0 00-1.925 3.546 5.974 5.974 0 01-2.133-1A3.75 3.75 0 0012 18z',
            hvac: 'M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5',
            air: 'M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 008.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 01-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 017.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 00-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0112 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0121 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0112 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 013 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418',
          };
          return (
            <a href={svc.href} class="group bg-white border border-brand-blue/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center text-center">
              <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-brand-blue/5 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-brand-red mb-5 group-hover:bg-brand-red group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300">
                <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d={icons[svc.icon]} /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">{svc.title}</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium leading-relaxed">{svc.desc}</p>
              <span class="mt-4 text-sm font-bold text-brand-red inline-flex items-center gap-1 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300">
                Learn More
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" /></svg>
              </span>
            </a>
          );
        })}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block bg-brand-blue/10 text-brand-blue text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4">More Services</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-blue mb-4">Repair, Airflow & Comfort Controls</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">Focused service pages for common problems that need more than a general category link.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {[
          { title: 'AC Repair', desc: 'General air-conditioning diagnostics and repair.', href: '/services/air-conditioning-services/ac-repair/' },
          { title: 'HVAC Repair', desc: 'Complete heating and cooling system repair.', href: '/services/hvac-services/hvac-repair/' },
          { title: 'Duct Cleaning', desc: 'Remove dust and debris from HVAC ductwork.', href: '/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/duct-cleaning/' },
          { title: 'Ductless Mini-Split Services', desc: 'Ductless installation, repair, and maintenance.', href: '/services/ductless-mini-split-services/' },
          { title: 'Thermostat Services', desc: 'Thermostat installation, repair, replacement, and smart setup.', href: '/services/thermostat-services/' },
        ].map((svc) => (
          <a href={svc.href} class="group bg-white border border-brand-blue/10 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition-all">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-blue mb-2 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">{svc.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">{svc.desc}</p>
            <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">Learn More →</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServicePageLayout>
